<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(f) </span><em id="A6.F6.sf6.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">walk_1_subject_1</em></figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 6: </span>Mean reward curves for all six LAFAN motion-tracking tasks on the G1 humanoid.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A6.F7" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
